      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. Construction Board Established. There is established in the Office of the Mayor a Construction Board consisting of the Director, who shall serve as Chairman, the Director of the Office of Management and Budget (hereinafter called OMB), the Director of Operations, the Corporation Counsel and the Chairman of the City Planning Commission, or their delegates, and, with the agreement of the Comptroller, the Comptroller or his delegate. All rules and regulations and directives issued by the Director that involve the Comptroller's duties and responsibilities mandated by law and the fiscal policies and procedures that ensue from them or the budgetary policies of the OMB shall be submitted to the Comptroller or to OMB respectively prior to promulgation.",
