      "text": "\u00a7 13. The Director shall serve as liaison with the Construction industry in New York City. He shall attempt to resolve problems which arise in connection with private construction work by bringing those problems to the attention of the appropriate operating agency for action and providing, where appropriate, assistance in their resolution. Such problems shall be acted upon expeditiously by each agency.",
